  "safety": {
   "cautions": [
    "Lying head-down raises pressure in the head; skip the decline with uncontrolled high blood pressure, glaucoma or a recent eye or head problem (clinical opinion), and sit up slowly after the set.",
    "Hook the feet under the roller before taking the weights; hand the weights down or lower them to the floor beside the bench at the end.",
    "Stop if sharp pain, numbness or tingling occurs.",
